type: software
title: gas-trajectories-in-kerogen
abstract: >-
  Trajectory analysis of gas molecules in kerogen pore structures: trapping-event
  classification (distance-matrix, Neyman-Pearson, Bayesian and hybrid analyzers),
  pore-network-model statistics, and the synthetic benchmarks used to validate them.
